#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "VERIFYING"
msgstr "VAHVISTETAAN"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Validated profile"
msgstr "Vahvistettu profiili"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Validating the token, discovering the zone, reading performance settings and"
" probing delivery."
msgstr ""
"Tunnistetta vahvistetaan, aluetta etsitään, suorituskykyasetuksia luetaan ja"
" toimitusta testataan."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Verification pending."
msgstr "Vahvistus odottaa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Verified means YPerf observed the feature working on this site. Verifying "
"means enabled but waiting for a matching request."
